tation_gate.py:594-596` builds the allow-list as `(root, basetemp)` and carries an\n  explicit comment that `sys.prefix` is DELIBERATELY absent — the venv is NOT writable.\n- `docs/local-dev-env.md:130` states the venv IS in the allow-list.\n\n## Why it is worth fixing rather than ignoring\n\nThe allow-list is the security boundary of a sandbox added in response to an incident that\ndestroyed `/opt/homebrew`. A reader reasoning about what a destructive mutant can reach will\nconsult the doc, and the doc currently describes a wider boundary than the code enforces. That\nerror is in the safe direction for the machine and the unsafe direction for the reader's mental\nmodel — someone may 'fix' the code to match the doc.\n\nFound while verifying `chiffon-venomous-annelida`'s AC1, whose wording also names the venv.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `docs/local-dev-env.md` matches the code: the venv is not writable inside the sandbox.\n- [ ] The reason the venv is excluded is stated, so the next reader does not re-add it.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["docs","mutation","sandbox"],"ticket_id":"2523-b393-5c08-4f3f","ticket_type":"bug","title":"docs/local-dev-env.md says the venv is in the mutation sandbox allow-list; the code deliberately excludes it","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["615fdfaa-9750-4df8-828a-262a4080b326","0c92bd90-1271-4542-ade2-e1b7ca21d8bf"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787865411223429122,"uuid":"f0a7bb8e-72b0-40c0-a832-d8ae55279925"}